      "en": [
        "To be lost is to be fully present, and to be fully present is to be capable of being in uncertainty and mystery.",
        "REBECCA SOLNIT"
      ],
      "zh-hant": [
        "一棵樹長到它想長到的高度之後，它才知道怎樣的空氣適合它。",
