    },
    "06-02": {
      "en": [
        "Mirth is like a flash of lightning, that breaks through a gloom of clouds, and glitters for a moment.",
        "JOSEPH ADDISON"
      ],
      "zh-hant": [
        "成為自己生活的旁觀者，可以避免生活中的很多煩惱。",
