        "杨昌溢"
      ]
    },
    "07-06": {
      "en": [
        "I saw how I could let the years run off, buffet the winter through, and see the spring come in.",
        "HENRY DAVID THOREAU"
      ],
      "zh-hant": [
        "沒有絕望的處境，只有對處境絕望的人。",
        "哈爾西"
      ],
      "ja": [
