        "李梓萌"
      ]
    },
    "07-12": {
      "en": [
        "The heart of man is very much like the sea, it has its storms and tides, in depths it has its pearls too.",
        "VINCENT VAN GOGH"
      ],
      "zh-hant": [
        "其實秋天不是秋天，秋天是夏天努力地想要停止下來的那段時光。",
